scope: task-198 string native error ABI only

This marker records the focused native/bodyless typed-error contract that is
already validated for the built-in string boundary:

- string.fromUtf8(Slice<byte>) -> string throws Utf8Error.InvalidUtf8 through
  the typed enum value channel in VM and native AOT.
- string.sliceBytes(start: int, end: int) -> string throws
  StringSliceError.InvalidByteRange through the same channel in VM and native
  AOT.
- analyzer builtin/XRD effect metadata consumes the @errors contracts, and
  legacy Bytes/ByteSpan/ByteView aliases remain rejected.

This is not the full TASK_198_TYPED_NATIVE_ERRORS_READY marker.  The task-200
